function openRecipe(id){const r=allRecipes().find(x=>x.id===id);if(!r)return;const n=autoNutrition(r),facts=recipeFacts(r),d=$('#recipeDialog');$('#recipeDialogBody').innerHTML=`<div class="dialog-inner"><div class="dialog-hero"><img src="${recipeImage(r)}" alt="Food photography representing ${esc(r.name)}"><div><span class="mini-kicker">${esc(r.group)}</span><h2>${esc(r.name)}</h2><p>${esc(r.source||'CCD ARCHIVE')}</p><label class="field">SERVING SCALE<input id="recipeScale" type="range" min=".5" max="3" step=".5" value="1"><output id="recipeScaleOut">1×</output></label><div class="nutrition-ribbon" id="recipeScaled"></div></div></div><h3>VERTICAL INGREDIENT CHART</h3><div class="vertical-ingredients">${(r.ingredients?.length?r.ingredients:['ORIGINAL QUANTITIES NOT RECOVERED']).map((x,i)=>`<div><b>${i+1}</b><span>${esc(x)}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="what-expect"><h3>WHAT TO EXPECT / WHAT IT TASTES LIKE</h3><p>${esc(tasteText(r))}</p></div><h3>METHOD</h3><div class="recipe-facts">${(r.steps?.length?r.steps:['METHOD NOT RECOVERED IN THE ARCHIVE CARD.']).map((x,i)=>`<div>${i+1}. ${esc(x)}</div>`).join('')}</div><h3>THREE CCD ONE-LINERS</h3><div class="recipe-facts">${facts.map(x=>`<div>${esc(x)}</div>`).join('')}</div></div>`;function update(){const m=+$('#recipeScale').value;$('#recipeScaleOut').textContent=m+'×';$('#recipeScaled').innerHTML=nutRibbon(scaleNut(n,m))}$('#recipeScale').oninput=update;update();d.showModal()}
function unitFactor(p,u){if(p.unit==='TBSP')return u==='tsp'?1/3:u==='tbsp'?1:16;if(p.unit==='TSP')return u==='tsp'?1:u==='tbsp'?3:48;if(p.unit==='1/4 CUP')return u==='tsp'?1/12:u==='tbsp'?1/4:4;return 1}
